DTSTAMP:20260828T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270706
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270716
SUMMARY:HLPF: HLPF
LOCATION:New York
DESCRIPTION:Official provisional forum dates.\nStatus: official provisional. Because 2027 is an SDG Summit year\, the ordinary July ministerial-declaration sequence is not projected. The political-declaration bars use the 2023 Summit cycle only as a precedent\; the 2027 co-facilitator timetable is still pending.\nOfficial process source: https://hlpf.un.org/
URL:https://hlpf.un.org/
END:VEVENT
