SUMMARY:HLPF: SDG Summit
LOCATION:New York
DESCRIPTION:The Heads-of-State HLPF under the General Assembly will take place in September 2027. Exact dates are not yet published.\nStatus: tentative. Because 2027 is an SDG Summit year\, the ordinary July ministerial-declaration sequence is not projected. The political-declaration bars use the 2023 Summit cycle only as a precedent\; the 2027 co-facilitator timetable is still pending.\nOfficial process source: https://hlpf.un.org/
URL:https://hlpf.un.org/
