DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270907
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270928
SUMMARY:UNGA: UNGA opening and High-level Week
LOCATION:New York
DESCRIPTION:UNGA82 opens on 7 September 2027\; the general debate opens on 21 September. Other High-level Week events follow the official programme.\nStatus: official. General Third Committee preparation is separated from the odd-year UNGA Youth Resolution sequence. The August–October dates use the verified 2025 cycle as a precedent\, not as confirmed 2027 deadlines.\nOfficial process source: https://www.un.org/en/ga/about/ropga/sessions.shtml
URL:https://www.un.org/en/ga/about/ropga/sessions.shtml
